    <string name="plan_measure_progress">Your progress is the share of your plan\'s lessons you\'ve studied or already knew. Mastery, memory and weekly challenges show how well you know them.</string>
    <string name="plan_measure_full_reviews">Your preparation adds up your subjects, each counting as much as it\'s worth on the exam. A subject\'s preparation is how much you\'ve studied times how well you know it: right answers, memory and full reviews. Harder and more frequent topics count more, and a subject stays under 75%% until you\'ve answered them and done a full review in your test\'s format.</string>
    <string name="plan_measure_mocks">Your preparation adds up your subjects, each counting as much as it\'s worth on the exam. A subject\'s preparation is how much you\'ve studied times how well you know it: right answers, memory and mock exams. Harder and more frequent topics count more, and a subject stays under 75%% until you\'ve answered them and taken a mock exam.</string>
